---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
import '../../styles/toolchain.css';
---
<section id="toolchain">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head left reveal">
      <span class="kicker">the build stack</span>
      <h2>Built with our own tools</h2>
      <p>The compiler and the build scripts that turn kernel source into a flashable zip. Both in-house, both open.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tool-stack" data-stagger>
      <div class="banner reveal">
        <div class="txt">
          <span class="banner-kicker">compiler</span>
          <div class="banner-title">
            <h2>StormBreaker Clang</h2>
            <span class="banner-badge"><span class="dot"></span>active</span>
          </div>
          <p>Our in-house LLVM/Clang toolchain, built to compile StormBreaker kernels. Back in active development after a quiet spell.</p>
          <code class="banner-cmd">make CC=clang LLVM=1</code>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/stormbreaker-project/stormbreaker-clang" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          View the compiler <Icon name="arrowRight" />
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="banner reveal">
        <div class="txt">
          <span class="banner-kicker">build tool</span>
          <div class="banner-title">
            <h2>sworkflow</h2>
            <span class="banner-badge"><span class="dot"></span>active</span>
          </div>
          <p>The build scripts we use to compile and package every kernel. Configure, cross-compile, generate DTBO, and wrap it with AnyKernel3, in one command.</p>
          <code class="banner-cmd">{"sw build <device>"}</code>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/stormbreaker-project/sworkflow" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          View sworkflow <Icon name="arrowRight" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
